\Delta c_i = 133 + 496.4 - 182.4 - 615.3
\]

Adding the terms:

\[
\Delta c_i = 629.4 - 797.7
\]

\[
\Delta c_i = -168.3 \text{ J/K mol}
\]

The experimental molar solubilities are:
\[
\Delta c_i = -168.3 \text{ g/K mol}
\]

The final answer is \(\boxed{-168.3 \text{ g/K mol}}\).
