  - Thus, \(\left|V_{\alpha}\right| = \left|V_{\alpha \setminus \alpha}\right|\).
  - Since \(\left|L_{\alpha}\right| = \left|V_{\alpha}\right\), it follows that \(\left|L_{\alpha}\right| = \left|V_{\alpha \setminus \alpha}\\alpha\right|\).
