   - For \( n = 1 \), \( n(n+1) = 1 \times 2 = 2 \), not a perfect power.
   - For \( n = 2 \), \( n(n+1) = 2 \times 3 = 6 \), not a perfect power.
   - For \( n = 3 \), \( n(n+1) = 3 \times 4 = 12 \), not a perfect power.
