\]  
\[
\ln 10^{-1} = - \ln 10 \approx -3.305
\]  
\[
\ln 10^4 - \ln 10^{-1} = 13.22 - (-3.305) = 16.525
\]  

Simplify the denominator:  
\[
0.0012 - 0.0018 = -0.0006
