     \[
     \theta' = \arctan\left(\frac{v_y'}{v_x}\right) = \arctan\left(\frac{\frac{1}{3} v \sin \theta}{v \cos \theta}\right) = \arctan\left(\frac{1}{3} \tan \theta\right)
     \]

6. **Kinetic Energies**:
