4. **Final Form of the Unity Condition:**
   Combining these two cases, the unitarity condition can be written as:
   \[
   \sum_l S_{lm}^* S_{ln} = \delta_{mn}
   \]
   This is because the sum is 1 when \(m = n\) and 0 when \(m \neq n\), which is the definition of the Kronecker delta.

